# Go
/bin/
# The binary `go build ./cmd/invariant` writes at the root. Anchored, so
# cmd/invariant/ and every other path named invariant stay tracked (#955).
/invariant
*.test
*.out
# Coverage profiles, where go test writes them. Anchored, so a source file
# named coverage.go is tracked (#840).
/coverage.*

# TLC working state
states/
*.st

# Editors and OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
/out/
